<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 23/24.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 23/24.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Thursday, April 24 on Wednesady.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   24.04.97	  23.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5276	    6.5420</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3349	    2.3427</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5500	    4.5648</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1759	    3.1703</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5215	    0.5227</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7731	    0.7753</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2919	    0.2928</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8817	    6.8758</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6958	    0.6963</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2735	    1.2763</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
